<title>USA: Earthgrains knows of no reason for move.</title>
<headline>Earthgrains knows of no reason for move.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earthgrains Co Inc said Tuesday it knew of no reason for a rise in its share price, which was trading up 2-1/4 at 46-7/8 in the late morning.</p>
<p>&quot;I know of no new company announcements, no changes in analysts' expectations, no changes in analysts' earnings (estimates),&quot; Earthgrains spokeswoman Molly Salky said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
